OL,3,AMPs vote against fresh move to legalise
OL,4,Aassisted dying in England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis live page has now closed - read
OL,7,Fmore in our news story
OL,9,FMPs have voted against a fresh move to
OL,10,Flegalise assisted dying in England and
OL,11,FWales
OL,13,FThe bill was defeated with 270 MPs
OL,14,Fvoting for and 286 voting against -
OL,15,Fwhat happens now?
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
