OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMPs vote against fresh move to legalise
OL,4,Aassisted dying in England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Parliament has dropped the ball today.
OL,7,FIt will be picked up again as it must
OL,8,Fbe," bill sponsor MP Lauren Edwards
OL,9,Fsays, while Kim Leadbeater says "it is
OL,10,Fa matter of time before we introduce
OL,11,Fthat legislation and it does get
OL,12,Fpassed"
OL,14,FBut campaign group Assist Us To Live
OL,15,Fdescribes the result as a "victory" for
OL,16,Fdisabled and terminally ill people
OL,18,FIt was the second attempt to change the
OL,19,Flaw - last year an identical bill was
OL,20,Fsupported by MPs, but stalled and ran
OL,21,Fout of time in the House of Lords
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
