OL,3,AMPs vote against fresh move to legalise
OL,4,Aassisted dying in England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bill would have allowed adults with
OL,7,Ffewer than six months to live to apply
OL,8,Fto be given help to end their own life,
OL,9,Fsubject to certain safeguards
